    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game content primarily consists of light-hearted &quot;Roguelike&quot; elements and various mini-games. You will play as a soul seeking its memory, traversing different spaces to understand the protagonist's story, challenge diverse levels, unlock different characters, and discover hidden worlds.<br><br><strong>Points (Spirit Power)</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>During level challenges, you can modify character attributes using temporary points obtained from killing monsters. Make your own choices and enjoy the gameplay.<br></li><li>The game features multiple main scenes. Explore these scenes to obtain permanent points.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7401e55d9118a161fd14042b2d323af6.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Formation and Magical Items</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Inspired by Chinese novels, these are the spells and props you can use, each possessing powerful abilities and unique functions.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/6d385a89a4f7b27b887a8dd17824e7db.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Characters</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Throughout the game, you can unlock different characters, each with unique base attributes, attack methods, and magical items.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/573f93ddda405cfe86a21d14559c70ca.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Space Cracks</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Listen carefully and find the windmills in the scenes; they connect to fragments of space and memories.<br></li><li>Complete or experience these mini-games to earn rewards.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/a05664b732853409441e2be4cdf435c2.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong><strong></strong></strong><br></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The game content primarily consists of light-hearted &quot;Roguelike&quot; elements and various mini-games. You will play as a soul seeking its memory, traversing different spaces to understand the protagonist's story, challenge diverse levels, unlock different characters, and discover hidden worlds.<br><br><strong>Points (Spirit Power)</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>During level challenges, you can modify character attributes using temporary points obtained from killing monsters. Make your own choices and enjoy the gameplay.<br></li><li>The game features multiple main scenes. Explore these scenes to obtain permanent points.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/7401e55d9118a161fd14042b2d323af6.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Formation and Magical Items</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Inspired by Chinese novels, these are the spells and props you can use, each possessing powerful abilities and unique functions.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/6d385a89a4f7b27b887a8dd17824e7db.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Characters</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Throughout the game, you can unlock different characters, each with unique base attributes, attack methods, and magical items.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/573f93ddda405cfe86a21d14559c70ca.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong></strong><br><br><strong>Space Cracks</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Listen carefully and find the windmills in the scenes; they connect to fragments of space and memories.<br></li><li>Complete or experience these mini-games to earn rewards.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521030/extras/a05664b732853409441e2be4cdf435c2.avif?t=1746076232\" width=640 height=360 /></span><br><strong><strong></strong></strong><br></li></ul>",
